    "text": "2 days ago\nSpaceX's stock continues its march upward in after-hours session\nSpaceX's stock picked up steam as Friday's extended session progressed, and it was recently up 3.4%.\nThe stock closed 19% higher on its their first day of trading. That was not exactly a stellar performance -- Tesla's stock, for example, rose 41% when it debuted in 2010. But it was enough to carve a spot for the space company on a list of the top 10 biggest companies on earth by market cap.\nThe company is now the sixth biggest in the world by market value, with a valuation north of $2 trillion.",
